        "summary": "Korea Treasury bond yields ended lower on November 4, led by foreign net purchases of 14,033 3-year KTB futures contracts, with intraday yield declines paring towards the close as equities recovered. The 3-year KTB yield fell 2.2 bp to 3.714%, while the 10-year yield fell 3.3 bp to 3.968%.",
