        "summary": "The Bank of Korea and regulatory authorities will meet clearing house LCH in London next week to discuss offshore central clearing for KOFR-OIS transactions. KOFR-OIS accounted for a provisional 18.5% of domestic interest rate swaps in the third quarter.",
